  "question": {
    "text": "Two identical springs (spring constant =&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>) are connected to two light rigid rods in parallel combination and then a third spring (identical to the other two) is connected to this combination in series. The combined system is fixed to the ceiling and a block of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;is attached as shown in the figure. If the mass is slightly displaced and then let go, then the system shall oscillate with a time period of<br />\r<br />\r<img height=\"187\" src=\"assets\\qt0092_b67cc37531b3.jpeg\" width=\"195\" />"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
